e possible for me to ask you to draw our OC \"Bonfire Aya\"?\nFor your reference, the setting is as follows, but you can draw freely.\nBonfire Aya\nAya Kagaribi\nAya is a bob-cut girl who looks cool but has a hot personality.\nShe is known as a fire wizard and has the ability to interfere with flames and heat.\nShe has been parasitized by a hostile fire demon's household insects, which causes her to lose control of her abilities, and when she tries to forcefully increase her firepower, she ends up scorching not only herself but also her allies with her own flames. She is a lone wolf, not communicating with anyone, because she knows that she will be slowed down by this situation.\nShe never wanted to be a psychic. However, now that she has become one and is involved in the struggle over it, she does not want to cause trouble for others.\nShe is a very active person.\nI am thinking of using it for personal activities in general (illustrations for novels, introduction of characters on SNS and personal websites, announcements of personal activities, etc.).\nIf this is convenient for you, I would appreciate it.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1z29YgUDaDdIOFGBgB46lCwX4ndEs-PEL/view?usp=drivesdk", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Rc_ircle18/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2409397, "client_id": 1887057, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cf72da5d/uploads/origins/91b2f67f-b7f6-45cc-ad8c-fee6f0ffbbf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3c6536f6f24086562fa28bd81810910", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cf72da5d/uploads/origins/91b2f67f-b7f6-45cc-ad8c-fee6f0ffbbf1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3c6536f6f24086562fa28bd81810910, https://si.imgix.net/cf72da5d/uploads/origins/91b2f67f-b7f6-45cc-ad8c-fee6f0ffbbf1?bg=%23